cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Numen Pathfinding Benchmark: pathfinding test problems for Minecraft"
type: dataset
version: v3.1
date-released: 2026-11-01
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dwinovo/numen-pathfinding-benchmark"
url: "https://github.com/Dwinovo/numen-pathfinding-benchmark"
authors:
  - name: "Dwinovo"
abstract: >-
  Seven fixed 512x512 terrain regions generated by Minecraft 1.21.1 (overworld biomes, caves, nether)
  as region files, 840 pathfinding problems in three distance buckets, and reference answers under the
  physical-time cost of the Numen pathfinding module.
keywords:
  - pathfinding
  - benchmark
  - Minecraft
  - A*
